</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Tulu 3: Pushing frontiers in open language model post-training.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib21.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">arXiv preprint arXiv:2411.15124</em>, 2024.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib22" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Li et al. (2024)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
